        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 2,
          name: "Best Lists",
          item: `${SITE_URL}/best-of/`,
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 3,
          name: "Best Pumpkin Spice Protein Powder",
          item: `${SITE_URL}/best-pumpkin-spice-protein-powder/`,
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best pumpkin spice protein powder?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most people, PEScience Select Protein in Pumpkin Pie. Per the label it gives 24 g of protein in about 120 calories per scoop from a whey and casein blend that thickens well and bakes well. RYSE's Little Debbie flavor is sweeter, Nutricost's isolate has the most protein per scoop, and Naked Shake is the best dairy-free option. All are seasonal."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is pumpkin spice protein powder available all year?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Usually not. Most pumpkin flavors, including PEScience Pumpkin Pie, RYSE Pumpkin Spice Rolls, Naked Shake Pumpkin Spice and Orgain Pumpkin Spice, are described by their brands as seasonal or limited. They tend to appear in late summer and thin out by winter. Outside the season, a vanilla powder with pumpkin purée and pumpkin pie spice is the most reliable substitute."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does pumpkin spice protein powder contain real pumpkin?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
